c: name one two 2
$0 default: zensh
script: arg1 2
status 4
missing script status 127
exit 300 -> 44
-e status 1
pipefail 1
+ echo traced
traced
noexec 0
dollar-dash has c
zensh X (Zen OS)
profile-ran
var=1
noprofile var=
shlvl ok
syntax status 2
unterminated status 2
/
ppid ok
version var ok
[exit 0]
